Sling Model → OSGi → Servlet → ResourceResolver → Service User → Scheduler → Query Builder → Event Handler → CRX/JCR → Frontend

And especially the confusing pairs:

Don't confuse	Remember

@ValueMapValue vs @Inject	Property injection vs generic injection
@ChildResource vs @ValueMapValue	Child resource vs property
Resource vs Node	Sling abstraction vs JCR API
ResourceResolver vs Session	Sling API vs JCR API
Resource Type Servlet vs Path Servlet	Resource-based vs URL-path-based
Scheduler vs Job	Scheduled execution vs persisted/asynchronous job
Service User vs Admin User	Limited permissions vs administrative access
Run Mode vs OSGi Config	Environment selection vs configuration
Factory Config vs normal Config	Multiple configurations vs one configuration
Event Handler vs Scheduler	React to event vs execute at time/interval
Query Builder vs Resource API	Searching content vs navigating/accessing resources
/apps vs /libs	Project/application code vs product/libs
/content vs /conf	Website/content vs configuration



